_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p018","quote":"昆莫"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m025-0027","chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p025","quote":"昆莫"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m025-0041","chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p025","quote":"昆莫"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m025-0044","chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p025","quote":"昆莫"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m025-0052","chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p025","quote":"昆莫"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"3jf_ce1_jy2","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","source_id":"s-shiji123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p017","quote":"是後天子數問騫大夏之屬。騫既失侯，因言曰：「臣居匈奴中，聞烏孫王號昆莫，昆莫之父，匈奴西邊小國也。匈奴攻殺其父，而昆莫生棄於野。烏嗛肉蜚其上，狼往乳之。單于怪以為神，而收長之。及壯，使將兵，數有功，單于復以其父之民予昆莫，令長守於西（城）［域］。昆莫收養其民，攻旁小邑，控弦數萬，習攻戰。單于死，昆莫乃率其眾遠徙，中立，不肯朝會匈奴。匈奴遣奇兵擊，不勝，以為神而遠之，因羈屬之，不大攻。今單于新困於漢，而故渾邪地空無人。蠻夷俗貪漢財物，今誠以此時而厚幣賂烏孫，招以益東，居故渾邪之地，與漢結昆弟，其勢宜聽，聽則是斷匈奴右臂也。既連烏孫，自其西大夏之屬皆可招來而為外臣。」天子以為然，拜騫為中郎將，將三百人，馬各二匹，牛羊以萬數，齎金幣帛直數千巨萬，多持節副使，道可使，使遺之他旁國。"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji123-004","interpretation_note":"依本篇明示父子接家族根；未名保持未名，分支字母不表示出生排行，生母與婚姻另存。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}},{"id":"3jf_ce1_jy2_AA","label":"大祿（大宛列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"大祿","mention_ids":["c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0152","c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0231","c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0268"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0152","chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p018","quote":"大祿"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0231","chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p018","quote":"大祿"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0268","chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p018","quote":"大祿"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"3jf_ce1_jy2_A","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","source_id":"s-shiji123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p018","quote":"騫既至烏孫，烏孫王昆莫見漢使如單于禮，騫大慚，知蠻夷貪，乃曰：「天子致賜，王不拜則還賜。」昆莫起拜賜，其他如故。騫諭使指曰：「烏孫能東居渾邪地，則漢遣翁主為昆莫夫人。」烏孫國分，王老，而遠漢，未知其大小，素服屬匈奴日久矣，且又近之，其大臣皆畏胡，不欲移徙，王不能專制。騫不得其要領。昆莫有十餘子，其中子曰大祿，彊，善將眾，將眾別居萬餘騎。大祿兄為太子，太子有子曰岑娶，而太子蚤死。臨死謂其父昆莫曰：「必以岑娶為太子，無令他人代之。」昆莫哀而許之，卒以岑娶為太子。大祿怒其不得代太子也，乃收其諸昆弟，將其眾畔，謀攻岑娶及昆莫。昆莫老，常恐大祿殺岑娶，予岑娶萬餘騎別居，而昆莫有萬餘騎自備，國眾分為三，而其大總取羈屬昆莫，昆莫亦以此不敢專約於騫。"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji123-005","interpretation_note":"依本篇明示父子接家族根；未名保持未名，分支字母不表示出生排行，生母與婚姻另存。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}},{"id":"3jf_ce1_jy2_AB","label":"大祿兄（未名太子）（大宛列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"大祿兄","mention_ids":["c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0169"]},{"surface":"太子","mention_ids":["c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0173","c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0176","c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0185"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0169","chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p018","quote":"大祿兄"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0173","chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p018","quote":"太子"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0176","chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p018","quote":"太子"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0185","chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p018","quote":"太子"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"3jf_ce1_jy2_A","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","source_id":"s-shiji123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p018","quote":"騫既至烏孫，烏孫王昆莫見漢使如單于禮，騫大慚，知蠻夷貪，乃曰：「天子致賜，王不拜則還賜。」昆莫起拜賜，其他如故。騫諭使指曰：「烏孫能東居渾邪地，則漢遣翁主為昆莫夫人。」烏孫國分，王老，而遠漢，未知其大小，素服屬匈奴日久矣，且又近之，其大臣皆畏胡，不欲移徙，王不能專制。騫不得其要領。昆莫有十餘子，其中子曰大祿，彊，善將眾，將眾別居萬餘騎。大祿兄為太子，太子有子曰岑娶，而太子蚤死。臨死謂其父昆莫曰：「必以岑娶為太子，無令他人代之。」昆莫哀而許之，卒以岑娶為太子。大祿怒其不得代太子也，乃收其諸昆弟，將其眾畔，謀攻岑娶及昆莫。昆莫老，常恐大祿殺岑娶，予岑娶萬餘騎別居，而昆莫有萬餘騎自備，國眾分為三，而其大總取羈屬昆莫，昆莫亦以此不敢專約於騫。"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji123-006","interpretation_note":"依本篇明示父子接家族根；未名保持未名，分支字母不表示出生排行，生母與婚姻另存。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}},{"id":"3jf_ce1_jy2_ABA","label":"岑娶（大宛列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"岑娶","mention_ids":["c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0181","c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0202","c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0225","c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0256","c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0271","c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0275","c-shiji-123-dayuan:m025-0064"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0181","chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p018","quote":"岑娶"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0202","chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p018","quote":"岑娶"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0225","chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p018","quote":"岑娶"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0256","chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p018","quote":"岑娶"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0271","chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p018","quote":"岑娶"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m018-0275","chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p018","quote":"岑娶"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m025-0064","chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p025","quote":"岑娶"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"3jf_ce1_jy2_AB","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","source_id":"s-shiji123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p018","quote":"騫既至烏孫，烏孫王昆莫見漢使如單于禮，騫大慚，知蠻夷貪，乃曰：「天子致賜，王不拜則還賜。」昆莫起拜賜，其他如故。騫諭使指曰：「烏孫能東居渾邪地，則漢遣翁主為昆